                <mxCell id="cd-steps" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFE6CC;strokeColor=#D79B00;fontSize=11" value="&lt;b&gt;build&lt;/b&gt; (ubuntu-latest)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;1 · gate: Dockerfile exists?&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&#39;#CC6600&#39;&gt;&lt;b&gt;SKIP → M0.5&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; — build=false today&lt;br&gt;2 · QEMU + buildx (amd64 + arm64)&lt;br&gt;3 · login ghcr.io (GITHUB_TOKEN)&lt;br&gt;4 · build-push :edge · :sha-⟨SHA⟩&lt;br&gt;5 · SBOM — spdx-json per :sha image&lt;br&gt;6 · cosign keyless sign + attest (by digest)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;steps 2–6 run only when the gate passes&lt;/i&gt;" vertex="1">
